<div id="2026-09-25-firefox-grokcom-permanent" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-09-25 — Permanent Firefox grok.com usage monitor</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Sideloaded <code>grokcom-usage@comserv.local</code> watches grok.com Settings → Usage, records Build/Chat % on DOM change, and writes current + history JSON for <code>/ai/usage</code>.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Temporary add-ons die on Firefox restart. Numbers only — no grok.com cookies.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>script/firefox-grokcom-usage/</code></p>
</div>
